        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203490/extras/1192383ee53015d38734faee78e426d4.poster.avif?t=1786775747\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203490/extras/1192383ee53015d38734faee78e426d4.webm?t=1786775747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203490/extras/1192383ee53015d38734faee78e426d4.mp4?t=1786775747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing × English!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Typing English” is a two-in-one game where you practice typing and learn English vocabulary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It includes 2,809 words — the New General Service List, a frequency-ranked core vocabulary that covers at least 92% of the words you meet in everyday English. Those same words cover 94% of TOEIC vocabulary, so they double as groundwork for the TOEIC test and other English exams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 149 stages are arranged in order of word frequency, so you learn the words you will actually run into first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three question modes to choose from. The more stars, the fewer clues: you move from copying a word to recalling it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• ★☆☆ Word — both the English word and its meaning are shown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• ★★☆ Meaning — only the meaning is shown; recall the spelling and type it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• ★★★ Sound — pronunciation is your only clue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 2,809 words come with pronunciation audio, and it plays in every mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure where to start? Take the level test. It asks 21 words, from easy to hard, then gives you a rank and tells you which stage to play next. Retake it whenever you like to see how far you have come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now in 16 languages! Word meanings are shown in your own language, so you never have to reach for a dictionary. In English, you get English definitions rather than translations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supported languages: English, Japanese, Spanish, German, French, Italian, Portuguese, Swedish, Dutch, Russian, Turkish, Greek, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Polish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Supports mouse &amp; keyboard or keyboard-only operation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Supports a wide range of monitor sizes and resizable windows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fully playable offline</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203490/extras/1192383ee53015d38734faee78e426d4.poster.avif?t=1786775747\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203490/extras/1192383ee53015d38734faee78e426d4.webm?t=1786775747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203490/extras/1192383ee53015d38734faee78e426d4.mp4?t=1786775747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing × English!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Typing English” is a two-in-one game where you practice typing and learn English vocabulary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It includes 2,809 words — the New General Service List, a frequency-ranked core vocabulary that covers at least 92% of the words you meet in everyday English. Those same words cover 94% of TOEIC vocabulary, so they double as groundwork for the TOEIC test and other English exams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 149 stages are arranged in order of word frequency, so you learn the words you will actually run into first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three question modes to choose from. The more stars, the fewer clues: you move from copying a word to recalling it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• ★☆☆ Word — both the English word and its meaning are shown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• ★★☆ Meaning — only the meaning is shown; recall the spelling and type it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• ★★★ Sound — pronunciation is your only clue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 2,809 words come with pronunciation audio, and it plays in every mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure where to start? Take the level test. It asks 21 words, from easy to hard, then gives you a rank and tells you which stage to play next. Retake it whenever you like to see how far you have come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now in 16 languages! Word meanings are shown in your own language, so you never have to reach for a dictionary. In English, you get English definitions rather than translations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supported languages: English, Japanese, Spanish, German, French, Italian, Portuguese, Swedish, Dutch, Russian, Turkish, Greek, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Polish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Supports mouse &amp; keyboard or keyboard-only operation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Supports a wide range of monitor sizes and resizable windows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fully playable offline</p>",
        "short_description": "Typing × English! Practice typing while learning English vocabulary. 2,809 words that cover over 92% of everyday English and 94% of TOEIC vocabulary, across 149 stages ordered by frequency. Now with three question modes and pronunciation audio for every word!",
